world of Cephiro, I, Hikaru Shidou...

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.200
...along with Umi Ryuuzaki
and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.080
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.050
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.
Autozam

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:14.750
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.
Eagle

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.550
There, three countries...
Eagle

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.420
There, three countries...
Geo Zazu

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.550
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren
were invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Geo Zazu

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.560
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren
were invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Chizeta

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.560
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren
were invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.490
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren
were invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Tarta Tatra

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.060
The three of us, as Magic Knights...
Tarta Tatra

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.490
The three of us, as Magic Knights...
Fahren

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.060
...promised to fight together and
protect this country from the invaders...
Fahren

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.060
...promised to fight together and
protect this country from the invaders...
Sang Yung Chang Ang

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.100
...promised to fight together and
protect this country from the invaders...
Aska

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:30.570
...and to find a new Pillar.
Aska

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.400
...and to find a new Pillar.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.800
...and to find a new Pillar.
Lantis

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.840
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Lantis

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.840
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Castle Debonair

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.940
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Nova

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:38.970
Nova

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:39.570
Debonair...
Nova

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:39.940
Debonair...

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.440
...and Nova, a girl
who looks just like me.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.780
...and Nova, a girl
who looks just like me.
Debonair

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.340
Who in the world are they?
Debonair

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.250
Guided by Master Smith Presea...

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:53.010
...I went inside my
own heart to revive my sword...

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.350
...but Nova intruded
and attacked me.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.980
Umi and Fuu are still
in enemy hands too...

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:07.570
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:15.400
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.220
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.380
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:33.280
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.260
And then the light
that floods down...

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:44.230
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:52.380
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:59.580
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:05.820
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:11.790
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:19.230
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:27.150
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:36.150
Umi and the Ambition of Tarta & Tatra

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.910
Eagle! Geo!

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.980
What's going on? I got a call
but was suddenly cut off...

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.310
Chief Mechanic!

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.280
Y-Yes?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.980
The commander's FTO will
launch in six hours Autozam time!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.920
Also, put my GTO in standby mode.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.750
Hey, Eagle...

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.500
Is something the matter?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.770
I'm all right.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.830
I just slipped a little.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.070
But...

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:31.100
Now get to work.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.610
Oh, be sure to equip the GTO
with a rocket launcher too.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:39.790
Zazu!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.550
This time,
we're going to invade seriously.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.720
Okay!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.230
Geo...

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:57.860
We're attacking in six hours.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.140
As subcommander,
I demand this, no matter what.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:06.410
But if we wait six hours,
the two Magic Knights may return...

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.210
Six hours.

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.050
That's all the time you get to rest.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.720
I'll lend you my bed, so get to sleep.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.390
After that...

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.020
...I'll follow my commander's orders.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.990
You're really a good person, Geo.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.500
I'm upset at you right now.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:33.040
Even if you praise me,
you're not getting any sweets.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.050
Lantis...

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.810
Hikaru...

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.700
Hikaru...

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.980
My cute little Hikaru...

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.390
You were able
to believe in your teammates...

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:55.980
...but you couldn't overcome the part
of your heart you didn't know existed.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.910
Lantis...

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:44.400
Hold on! Hold on!

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.540
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.380
What's with this weird outfit?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.510
And the cage?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.410
Why have you just been
standing there all this time?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.050
Answer me!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:08.630
I caught you, one who
controls a Rune-God of Cephiro.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.600
I am the younger
princess of Chizeta, Tarta!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.380
I am the elder sister, Tatra.
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.770
Hey, you.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.280
What's your name?

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:30.320
I see no reason for you
to address me as "hey, you."

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.420
Whut was that?

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:32.550
Whut was that?
Something wrong?

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.820
You're awful cheeky for a prisoner!

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:38.480
And why should I be down
just because I got caught?

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:42.590
Ain't it good manners to introduce
yourself after someone else does?

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:46.130
I never asked you
to tell me your name!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.800
Whut are you thinkin', you jackass?

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.300
Once again, Tarta...

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:54.100
Mind your language.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.640
I-I see...

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.310
The Osaka dialect, just like Caldina.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.480
Hush up! Hush up! Hush up!

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.450
You cheeky gal, come out here!

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:14.760
How do you expect me
to get out in this situation?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.740
Take a weapon! Equip armor!

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.770
You know...

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.680
You were the ones who took
my clothes, including my armor!

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.790
We didn't mean to strip you.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:45.190
When we were checking to see
if you had anything suspicious...

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:49.390
...all your clothes disappeared
on their own into this glove.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:55.130
So we dressed you in clothes from
our country. You should be grateful!

00:08:56.070 --> 00:09:00.200
If possible, I would've preferred
clothes that didn't show my midriff.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.640
I look really weird wearing
the glove with this outfit.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.780
I'm Umi.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.220
Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.790
Tarta of Chizeta.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.460
I will test your true strength!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.000
Prepare yourself!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.910
Not bad.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.710
Neither are you.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.190
What is this?

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:25.220
L-Looking at this closely,
it has a weird face.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.430
How dare you destroy that statue!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.920
You were the one who destroyed it!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.930
Ain't no way
you'll get away with it now!

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:36.690
Hold on...

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:37.900
Would you...

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.700
...stop it already!

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.150
Looks like the match is over.

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.730
Stop it!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:20.600
Tarta challenged her to a match.
This person cannot be blamed.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.150
Stand back!

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:34.960
Now, if you'd come over here.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:38.500
Let's have some tea
after all that exercise.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:50.700
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:57.710
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.560
Here.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.110
There's no poison in it.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:38.790
We are the proud
princesses of Chizeta.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:44.760
We would not defeat even the worst
of enemies with underhanded tactics.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.530
It's delicious.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:57.070
I'm glad.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:05.550
Tell me...

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.650
Why are you sending
your troops to Cephiro?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:14.760
I want to know
what you're fighting for.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:20.900
Otherwise, I'm sure
I'll end up regretting things again...

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.360
Again?

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:33.070
Go ahead and tell her.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:43.410
It's to expand the territory
ruled by our country, Chizeta.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.830
Chizeta is, well...

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:57.660
...cramped.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.500
It doesn't look that way...

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.630
Not all of that is Chizeta's territory.

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.480
The land governed by Chizeta is...

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:14.110
...just this part.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.020
I-It might be cramped...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:24.130
So if I or my elder sister,
Tatra, can become Cephiro's Pillar...

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:27.030
We could make
our country a little bigger.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.070
That's what Tarta thinks.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.540
I promised Mother and Father...

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.930
...to be sure to make
Cephiro our territory!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:37.670
And...

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:43.410
...I'll name it Chizeta Number Two!

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:50.220
I'm sorry.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.850
Tarta is excitable.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.520
There's nothing
the Pillar of Cephiro can't do!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:59.930
With enough willpower,
there's no wish she can't grant...

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.520
That's not true!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.870
The Pillar...

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.100
...can't do anything for herself.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:15.040
Not even a wish as simple as,
"I want to be happy with the one I love."

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:20.650
She must continue praying
only for the stability of the world.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:29.300
She had to die just
because she fell in love.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:33.430
Do you really want
to become someone like that?

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:46.850
If you say that you'll invade
Cephiro, I will have to fight you.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.710
Where are you going?

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:56.020
I'm going back to Cephiro.

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:10.230
I promised that
I would fight for Cephiro.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.540
That I would fight for myself...

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:18.380
...and with my teammates.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:20.680
Selece!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.050
W-Wait!

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.330
That girl is getting away!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.420
Tatra, the spirits!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:41.900
Are you sure?

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.830
Are you sure you want to fight her?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:53.140
Your face tells me that
you're debating it right now.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.010
You won't regret this?

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.990
Appear, our guardian spirits...

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.750
Djinn!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:21.570
I still...

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:30.640
I still can't stand these macho types.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:36.990
Water Dragon!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:48.100
I guess that was better
than them sucking it in...

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:10.480
Sheesh!

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:12.720
Leave me alone already!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.430
W-What was that voice just now?

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.050
Eek!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.350
"Eek"?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.450
What kind of voice
does this thing have?

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:49.560
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.270
T-That was kind of disappointing...

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.240
Umi! Fuu!

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.920
Hikaru!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.160
Ms. Hikaru!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.910
I did it!

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.440
I really did it!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:47.080
I got someone who
controls a legendary Rune-God!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.820
Giant Sang Yung was strong!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.620
Right, Sang Yung?

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:54.090
Y-You think so?

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:56.030
I do!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:20:00.530
I couldn't win with the lion,
but I was able to with giant Sang Yung!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.470
Sang Yung is strong!

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.170
Thank you, Sang Yung!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:13.140
Lady Aska, that was the last time
you will use a high-level illusion!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.070
I hear nothing.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:16.380
Lady Aska!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.860
You have brought
the one from Cephiro!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:43.740
Y-You were the one
in that Rune-God?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:51.240
Hey, I'm asking if you were
the one in the Rune-God!

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:52.790
Answer me!

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.460
Yes.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.780
My name is Fuu Hououji.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.520
Pleased to meet you.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.660
She is a polite person.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:11.430
Yes. If only Lady Aska could
properly introduce herself like that...

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.560
Oh...

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:18.070
Silence!

00:22:18.010 --> 00:22:23.440
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:31.350
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:38.350
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:42.860
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:45.630
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:50.730
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:54.470
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.880 --> 00:23:01.800
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.220 --> 00:23:05.650
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:14.380
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:20.560
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:28.870
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:37.750
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:48.420
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.420
I have been captured
by the Dome of Fahren.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:56.800
Ms. Aska demanded my Rune-God,
so I challenged her to an archery match.

00:23:56.900 --> 00:23:59.840
If she wins,
I hand over my Rune-God.

00:23:59.940 --> 00:24:04.400
If I win, I am to be returned
to Cephiro. Those were the conditions.

00:24:04.550 --> 00:24:06.670
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.780 --> 00:24:09.480
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match.

00:24:09.480 --> 00:24:09.950
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match.

00:24:09.950 --> 00:24:12.290
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match
Please be sure to watch it!

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:13.490
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:20.390
Who is it today?

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:23.390
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:29.460
Look forward to the next episode!
